  "global_rules": [
    "Map must remain unsettling with zero zombies present.",
    "Use silence deliberately; do not fill every second with horror audio.",
    "Lighting must create shape, silhouettes, depth and uncertainty, not just visibility.",
    "Every major zone gets its own lighting identity and ambient sound family.",
    "At least one readable, one suggestive and one unresolved environmental detail per major zone.",
    "Power changes atmosphere as well as mechanics.",
    "Rare ambient events use cooldowns, weighting and match limits so they remain unpredictable.",
    "Lore should be discoverable through the physical world before exposition.",
    "Never show enemies visibly popping into existence.",
    "Maintain mobile combat readability and accessibility.",
    "Do not ship ripped Call of Duty/Treyarch assets."
  ],
